    "hook": {
      "text": "Rest a hand on your chest. Feel that thump, thump, thump? Your heart ticks along at an even speed, like a clock. Music has a tick like that too. Press one key below again and again, as evenly as you can. Can you keep it as steady as a heartbeat?",
